# iOS build artifacts — produced by the ios-xcframework CI job, not committed.
# `xcodebuild -create-xcframework` refuses to write into an existing output
# ("librefrain_core.a couldn't be copied ... an item with the same name
# already exists"), so a committed copy turns that job red. Headers/ is a
# copy of refrain-core/bindings/swift/, which IS committed and verified.
refrain-core/Headers/
refrain-core/RefrainCore.xcframework/
